[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_00_0010","text":"你们俩\n要不要稍微休息一下？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_00_0020","text":"……制作人\n好啊，那就稍微休息一下吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_00_0030","text":"好……好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_00_0040","text":"太好了\n我带了些慰问品来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_00_0005","text":"饮料"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_00_0006","text":"饭团"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_00_0007","text":"肉包子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_01_0010","text":"那，我就不客气啦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_01_0020","text":"谢谢\n正好口渴了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_02_0010","text":"饭团……现在就算了\n吃了身体会变重"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_02_0020","text":"这样啊……！\n那，等结束之后再吃吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_03_0010","text":"肉包子吗——？\n刚跳完舞热得要死呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07090000_03_0020","text":"啊，也是\n应该带别的来的……！"}]
